---
pre-compare: sort
---

// Synthetic PAN-OS Data Filtering records; every value is invented. The column
// order follows the PAN-OS 11.1 Data Filtering log fields.
// https://docs.paloaltonetworks.com/ngfw/administration/monitoring/use-syslog-for-monitoring/syslog-field-descriptions/data-filtering-log-fields
// A blocked file and matched non-file content become Data Security Findings
// with the data pattern, the user, and the matched file.
from_file env("TENZIR_INPUT") {
  read_lines
}
this = line.parse_syslog()
paloalto::ocsf::normalize
this = ocsf_cast(ocsf_derive(this))
drop raw_data, raw_data_size, metadata
drop_null_fields
